# Copy to `local.properties` (gitignored) and fill in.
#
# Google Maps / Navigation SDK key, injected into AndroidManifest.xml as the
# `MAPS_API_KEY` manifest placeholder by app/build.gradle. The key needs the
# Maps SDK for Android *and* the Navigation SDK for Android enabled on its
# Google Cloud project, and must be allowed for the `com.bhy` package plus the
# signing certificate you build with.
MAPS_API_KEY=
